lede: Curious rather than ambitious, engaged without being revealing, and noncommittal in a way that reads as easy and is actually a skill (TR).
calls:
k: On the record
Vivienne Hale of Covenant Basin, twenty-three. Self-nominated on impulse after two years of thinking about it. Third in Lone's Regional Assessment (TR).
||
k: Her fate
Her ankle fails on a Day 1 slope in Endurance, and she's extracted at the first checkpoint (TR). She goes home knowing more about how the Crownward works than anyone there will know what to do with (TR).
/end

@page rh="THE COVENANT DAUGHTERS · IX · VIVIENNE · THE RECORD AND HER DOMINION" m="TKC: TR · DOM; VOL. I · {v1:lone} · {v1:lived4}"
# Covenant Basin
plate: doc
dh: Covenant Registry | LONE DOMINION · COVENANT BASIN
df: Candidate | HALE, Vivienne · twenty-three
df: Nominated by | herself (TR)
df: Regional Assessment | third
df: Selected because | clean and interesting, and to avoid a nepotism story about the first-ranked girl (TR)
stamp: COVENANT DAUGHTER
